  "slug": "a-happy-day",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/23410_a-happy-day.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "My name is Dawei and I am a student. Now I am studying Chinese in China. I have a good friend named Martin. We are all college students, and we all like China. We like to eat Chinese food. The buns, dumplings and noodles are all delicious. We also like to drink Chinese tea. Today is Saturday, we don't have classes. At ten o'clock in the morning, we went to the mall to buy clothes. In the afternoon we went to see a movie. We cook our own meals in the evening. We are very happy today."
  ],
  "english_full": "My name is Dawei and I am a student. Now I am studying Chinese in China. I have a good friend named Martin. We are all college students, and we all like China. We like to eat Chinese food. The buns, dumplings and noodles are all delicious. We also like to drink Chinese tea. Today is Saturday, we don't have classes. At ten o'clock in the morning, we went to the mall to buy clothes. In the afternoon we went to see a movie. We cook our own meals in the evening. We are very happy today.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Меня́ зову́т Давэ́й, и я студе́нт. Сейча́с я изуча́ю кита́йский язы́к в Кита́е. У меня́ есть хоро́ший друг по и́мени Ма́ртин. Мы о́ба студе́нты университе́та, и мы о́чень лю́бим Кита́й. Мы лю́бим есть кита́йскую еду́. Паровы́е бу́лочки, пельме́ни и лапша́ — всё о́чень вку́сно. Мы та́кже лю́бим пить кита́йский чай. Сего́дня суббо́та, у нас нет заня́тий. В де́сять часо́в утра́ мы пошли́ в торго́вый центр покупа́ть оде́жду. Днём мы пошли́ в кино́. Ве́чером мы са́ми гото́вим себе́ еду́. Сего́дня был о́чень счастли́вый день."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Menyá zovút Davéy, i ya studént. Seychás ya izucháyu kitáyskiy yazýk v Kitáye. U menyá yest' khoróshiy drug po ímeni Mártin. My óba studénty universitéta, i my óchen' lyúbim Kitáy. My lyúbim yest' kitáyskuyu yedú. Parovýye búlochki, pel'méni i lapshá — vsyo óchen' vkúsno. My tákzhe lyúbim pit' kitáyskiy chay. Segódnya subbóta, u nas net zanyátiy. V désyat' chasóv utrá my poshli v torgóvyy tsentr pokupát' odézhdu. Dnyom my poshli v kinó. Vécherom my sámi gotóvim sebé yedú. Segódnya byl óchen' schastlívyy den'."
  ],
