    {
      "id": "story_23410_p0_c0",
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "text": "Меня́ зову́т Давэ́й, и я студе́нт.",
      "text_en": "My name is Dawei and I am a student.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Menyá\" data-defn=\"me (acc./gen.)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">Меня́</span><rt>Menyá</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zovút\" data-defn=\"is named / they call\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">зову́т</span><rt>zovút</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Davéy\" data-defn=\"David (name)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">Давэ́й</span><rt>Davéy</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"i\" data-defn=\"и\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">и</span><rt>i</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ya\" data-defn=\"я\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">я</span><rt>ya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"studént\" data-defn=\"student / university student\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">студе́нт</span><rt>studént</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "Menyá zovút Davéy, i ya studént.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.96,
      "duration": 1.96
    },
    {
      "id": "story_23410_p0_c1",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "text": "Сейча́с я изуча́ю кита́йский язы́к в Кита́е.",
      "text_en": "Now I am studying Chinese in China.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Seychás\" data-defn=\"now / at present\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">Сейча́с</span><rt>Seychás</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ya\" data-defn=\"я\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">я</span><rt>ya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"izucháyu\" data-defn=\"I study / learn (изучать)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">изуча́ю</span><rt>izucháyu</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kitáyskiy\" data-defn=\"Chinese (language/adj)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">кита́йский</span><rt>kitáyskiy</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yazýk\" data-defn=\"language / tongue\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">язы́к</span><rt>yazýk</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"v\" data-defn=\"в\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">в</span><rt>v</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Kitáe\" data-defn=\"China (prepositional: в Китае)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">Кита́е</span><rt>Kitáe</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "Seychás ya izucháyu kitáyskiy yazýk v Kitáye.",
      "start": 2.31,
      "end": 4.95,
      "duration": 2.64
    },
    {
      "id": "story_23410_p0_c2",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "text": "У меня́ есть хоро́ший друг по и́мени Ма́ртин.",
      "text_en": "I have a good friend named Martin.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"U\" data-defn=\"у\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">У</span><rt>U</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"menyá\" data-defn=\"me (acc./gen.)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">меня́</span><rt>menyá</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"est&#x27;\" data-defn=\"to eat / there is\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">есть</span><rt>est&#x27;</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"khoróshiy\" data-defn=\"good / nice\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">хоро́ший</span><rt>khoróshiy</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"drug\" data-defn=\"friend\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">друг</span><rt>drug</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"po\" data-defn=\"по\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">по</span><rt>po</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ímeni\" data-defn=\"name (gen. of имя)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">и́мени</span><rt>ímeni</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Mártin\" data-defn=\"Martin (name)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">Ма́ртин</span><rt>Mártin</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "U menyá yest' khoróshiy drug po ímeni Mártin.",
      "start": 5.3,
      "end": 7.6,
      "duration": 2.3
    },
    {
      "id": "story_23410_p0_c3",
      "chunk_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "text": "Мы о́ба студе́нты университе́та, и мы о́чень лю́бим Кита́й.",
      "text_en": "We are all college students, and we all like China.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"My\" data-defn=\"мы\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">Мы</span><rt>My</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"óba\" data-defn=\"both\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">о́ба</span><rt>óba</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"studénty\" data-defn=\"students\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">студе́нты</span><rt>studénty</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"universitéta\" data-defn=\"university (genitive)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">университе́та</span><rt>universitéta</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"i\" data-defn=\"и\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">и</span><rt>i</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"my\" data-defn=\"мы\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">мы</span><rt>my</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"óchen&#x27;\" data-defn=\"very / very much\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">о́чень</span><rt>óchen&#x27;</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lyúbim\" data-defn=\"we love / like (любить)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">лю́бим</span><rt>lyúbim</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Kitáy\" data-defn=\"China\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">Кита́й</span><rt>Kitáy</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "My óba studénty universitéta, i my óchen' lyúbim Kitáy.",
      "start": 7.95,
      "end": 11.19,
      "duration": 3.24
    },
    {
      "id": "story_23410_p0_c4",
      "chunk_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "text": "Мы лю́бим есть кита́йскую еду́.",
      "text_en": "We like to eat Chinese food.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"My\" data-defn=\"мы\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">Мы</span><rt>My</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lyúbim\" data-defn=\"we love / like (любить)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">лю́бим</span><rt>lyúbim</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"est&#x27;\" data-defn=\"to eat / there is\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">есть</span><rt>est&#x27;</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kitáyskuyu\" data-defn=\"Chinese (acc. fem.)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">кита́йскую</span><rt>kitáyskuyu</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"edú\" data-defn=\"food / meal (acc. fem.)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">еду́</span><rt>edú</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "My lyúbim yest' kitáyskuyu yedú.",
      "start": 11.54,
      "end": 13.42,
      "duration": 1.88
    },
    {
      "id": "story_23410_p0_c5",
      "chunk_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "text": "Паровы́е бу́лочки, пельме́ни и лапша́ — всё о́чень вку́сно.",
      "text_en": "The buns, dumplings and noodles are all delicious.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Parovýe\" data-defn=\"steamed (adj. pl.)\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Паровы́е</span><rt>Parovýe</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"búlochki\" data-defn=\"buns / rolls (baozi)\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">бу́лочки</span><rt>búlochki</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"pel&#x27;méni\" data-defn=\"dumplings (jiaozi)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">пельме́ни</span><rt>pel&#x27;méni</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"i\" data-defn=\"и\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">и</span><rt>i</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lapshá\" data-defn=\"noodles\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">лапша́</span><rt>lapshá</rt></ruby> — <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"vsyo\" data-defn=\"all / everything\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">всё</span><rt>vsyo</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"óchen&#x27;\" data-defn=\"very / very much\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">о́чень</span><rt>óchen&#x27;</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"vkúsno\" data-defn=\"delicious / tasty\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">вку́сно</span><rt>vkúsno</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "Parovýye búlochki, pel'méni i lapshá — vsyo óchen' vkúsno.",
      "start": 13.77,
      "end": 17.1,
      "duration": 3.33
    },
    {
      "id": "story_23410_p0_c6",
      "chunk_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "text": "Мы та́кже лю́бим пить кита́йский чай.",
      "text_en": "We also like to drink Chinese tea.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"My\" data-defn=\"мы\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">Мы</span><rt>My</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tákzhe\" data-defn=\"also / as well\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">та́кже</span><rt>tákzhe</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lyúbim\" data-defn=\"we love / like (любить)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">лю́бим</span><rt>lyúbim</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"pit&#x27;\" data-defn=\"to drink\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">пить</span><rt>pit&#x27;</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kitáyskiy\" data-defn=\"Chinese (language/adj)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">кита́йский</span><rt>kitáyskiy</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chay\" data-defn=\"tea\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">чай</span><rt>chay</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "My tákzhe lyúbim pit' kitáyskiy chay.",
      "start": 17.45,
