      "duration": 2.09
    },
    {
      "id": "story_23410_p0_c7",
      "chunk_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "text": "Сего́дня суббо́та, у нас нет заня́тий.",
      "text_en": "Today is Saturday, we don't have classes.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Segódnya\" data-defn=\"today\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">Сего́дня</span><rt>Segódnya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"subbóta\" data-defn=\"Saturday\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">суббо́та</span><rt>subbóta</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"u\" data-defn=\"у\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">у</span><rt>u</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nas\" data-defn=\"нас\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">нас</span><rt>nas</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"net\" data-defn=\"no / there are no (+ gen.)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">нет</span><rt>net</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zanyátiy\" data-defn=\"classes / lessons (gen. pl.)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">заня́тий</span><rt>zanyátiy</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "Segódnya subbóta, u nas net zanyátiy.",
      "start": 19.89,
      "end": 22.37,
      "duration": 2.48
    },
    {
      "id": "story_23410_p0_c8",
      "chunk_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "text": "В де́сять часо́в утра́ мы пошли́ в торго́вый центр покупа́ть оде́жду.",
      "text_en": "At ten o'clock in the morning, we went to the mall to buy clothes.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"V\" data-defn=\"в\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">В</span><rt>V</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"désyat&#x27;\" data-defn=\"ten\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">де́сять</span><rt>désyat&#x27;</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chasóv\" data-defn=\"hours / o&#x27;clock (gen. pl.)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">часо́в</span><rt>chasóv</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"utrá\" data-defn=\"morning / a.m. (gen. of утро)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">утра́</span><rt>utrá</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"my\" data-defn=\"мы\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">мы</span><rt>my</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"poshlí\" data-defn=\"went (on foot, pl. past)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">пошли́</span><rt>poshlí</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"v\" data-defn=\"в\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">в</span><rt>v</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"torgóvyy\" data-defn=\"shopping / trade (adj)\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">торго́вый</span><rt>torgóvyy</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tsentr\" data-defn=\"center / mall\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">центр</span><rt>tsentr</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"pokupát&#x27;\" data-defn=\"to buy / shop for\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">покупа́ть</span><rt>pokupát&#x27;</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"odézhdu\" data-defn=\"clothes / clothing (acc.)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">оде́жду</span><rt>odézhdu</rt></ruby>.",
