      "duration": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "story_23410_p0_c9",
      "chunk_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "text": "Днём мы пошли́ в кино́.",
      "text_en": "In the afternoon we went to see a movie.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Dnyom\" data-defn=\"in the afternoon / by day\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">Днём</span><rt>Dnyom</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"my\" data-defn=\"мы\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">мы</span><rt>my</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"poshlí\" data-defn=\"went (on foot, pl. past)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">пошли́</span><rt>poshlí</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"v\" data-defn=\"в\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">в</span><rt>v</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kinó\" data-defn=\"cinema / movie\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">кино́</span><rt>kinó</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "Dnyom my poshli v kinó.",
      "start": 26.47,
      "end": 27.77,
      "duration": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "story_23410_p0_c10",
      "chunk_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "text": "Ве́чером мы са́ми гото́вим себе́ еду́.",
      "text_en": "We cook our own meals in the evening.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Vécherom\" data-defn=\"in the evening\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">Ве́чером</span><rt>Vécherom</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"my\" data-defn=\"мы\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">мы</span><rt>my</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"sámi\" data-defn=\"ourselves (emphatic)\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">са́ми</span><rt>sámi</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gotóvim\" data-defn=\"we cook / prepare (готовить)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">гото́вим</span><rt>gotóvim</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"sebé\" data-defn=\"for ourselves (dative reflexive)\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">себе́</span><rt>sebé</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"edú\" data-defn=\"food / meal (acc. fem.)\" data-hsk=\"A1\"><span class=\"si\">еду́</span><rt>edú</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "Vécherom my sámi gotóvim sebé yedú.",
      "start": 28.12,
      "end": 30.2,
      "duration": 2.08
    },
    {
      "id": "story_23410_p0_c11",
      "chunk_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 11,
